  # Announcing Rust 1.85.0 and Rust 2024

  The Rust team is happy to announce a new version of Rust, 1.85.0.

  ## Stabilized Features

  • Async closures (`async || { ... }`)
  • Naked functions

  ```rust
    async fn test() {}
  ```

